README: PODFoam hooks and the observer example

Under PODFoam in Contents, after the validation pointer, a paragraph
names HOOKS.md with the two optional functions and llm_demo/, the
example module that asks a local vision-language model about the running
solver. The hooks change neither U nor p, and with analysis_func the POD
step collects a snapshot at every time step.

